        },
        "description": {
          "en": "A .PHD level from a Tomb Raider install you own, in its DATA folder. Each level is converted separately into its own .PKD.",
          "de": "Eine .PHD-Leveldatei aus einer eigenen Tomb-Raider-Installation, im Ordner DATA. Jedes Level wird einzeln in eine eigene .PKD umgewandelt.",
          "fr": "Un niveau .PHD provenant d'une installation de Tomb Raider vous appartenant, dans son dossier DATA. Chaque niveau est converti séparément en son propre .PKD.",
          "es": "Un nivel .PHD de una instalación de Tomb Raider propia, en su carpeta DATA. Cada nivel se convierte por separado en su propio .PKD.",
          "pl": "Poziom .PHD z posiadanej instalacji Tomb Raider, z folderu DATA. Każdy poziom jest konwertowany osobno do własnego pliku .PKD.",
          "ja": "所有する Tomb Raider の DATA フォルダーにある .PHD レベルファイル。レベルごとに個別に変換され、それぞれの .PKD になります。",
          "ko": "보유한 Tomb Raider 설치본의 DATA 폴더에 있는 .PHD 레벨 파일. 레벨마다 개별적으로 변환되어 각각의 .PKD가 됩니다."
        },
        "extensions": [
          ".PHD"
        ],
        "maxBytes": 8388608,
        "strict": false,
        "$comment": "maxBytes covers the largest retail level, LEVEL10C.PHD at 3,532,024 bytes. maxCount 32 fits a whole DATA folder: 21 retail levels, with room for The Unfinished Business. strict is false because only GYM, LEVEL1 and LEVEL2 carry fixups, so an unrecognised level still packs correctly. The sha1 values come from a retail TR1 PC CD, cross-checked against the sha256 table in tools/extractor/src/level_ids.h.",
