  "$comment": "dataDir is 'openlara' because src/platform/gnw/os.cpp searches that literal folder name, which matches neither PACKED_BIN (OpenLara.bin) nor HB_NAME (OpenLara). originalSystem is 'dos' because the .PHD files this converter reads are the PC release's; the PlayStation and Saturn discs carry formats it cannot read."
